x.c('payload_envelope',0,32,46,'Admitted runtime payload envelope','Payload ledger is event-sourced read model; every traversal/authority/evidence/ambiguity/closure/provenance/retry/correction/register payload needs admitted envelope with ref,class,schema/contract,digest,producer,aggregate scope, applicable policy and available event,actor,authority,input digest.')
x.q('payload_admission_and_classification',0,38,46,'payload_envelope','External bodies require envelope identity/digest and admission. Observation/validation/rejection/authority/evidence/ambiguity/closure-input facts are runtime sources or deterministic projections. Classify missing,empty,malformed,unreadable,schema/contract-invalid,stale,orphaned,contradictory,accepted without worker-internal parsing. Assurance authority has deterministic authority/input id; assurance evidence binds scope,authority,input,payload,provenance,proof-shape distinguishing fulfilled/partial/missing/stale/orphan/contradictory/deferred/invalid-ledger.')
x.q('payload_authority_limits_and_refresh',0,48,62,'payload_envelope','Reports/dashboards/archives/releases/registers/Product ledgers are read models, not rival writers. Plugins may supply codecs/authority/evidence/ambiguity/closure-policy/gain adapters but ABG owns admission/emission/projection/closure relevance. GTL functions/vectors declare contracts,evidence,authority,hooks without side config. Success,self-assessment,empty unresolvedReasons,tests,archive shape require admitted payload/evidence first. Private reasoning/decomposition/tactics are not constitutional truth; treat as contract risk or exclude closure. Snapshots/audit events do not outrank source replay. Retry/correction/reopen/authority-input change preserves facts and requires fresh current projection. Domain semantic/gain/adapter gaps surface ambiguity/gaps, never silent closure.')
x.c('composition_payload_admission',0,64,78,'Composition and stage payload admission','Hook action/finding becomes owning truth only through ABG admission. Transform/evaluate/consequence/F_H outputs remain proposals until admitted, preserving stage category or causal selection. Composition payload/evidence carries selected ref/digest or linked selection; wrong composition is wrong-contract evidence, not satisfaction.')
x.q('selected_carrier_and_evaluation_contracts',0,66,78,'composition_payload_admission','Edge findings retain assurance/hook/gain/metrics/close/residual/continuation/evidence/authority/contribution refs and reject side authority. Vector outputs retain target contract ref/digest; only admitted selected-contract payload satisfies. Rejected/missing/wrong/malformed carriers remain nonclosing, never files/prose/arbitrary payload completion. Rule envelopes preserve rule/role/means,composition ref/digest/selection,regime/contribution,register/finding/evidence,pressure/continuation,diagnostics/rejection. Reject event/ledger/call-frame/vector/transition/continuation/closure authority. Traversal stages advance/bind/project only after selected result-interface/target/composition/basis admission, never raw files/archive/parser aliases.')
x.q('payload_obligation_and_materialization_conservation',0,80,89,'composition_payload_admission','Closure/bind/materialization/replay/downstream-affecting stage payloads retain intent-lineage and obligation-delta refs. Dropped obligations,target-carriers,materialization/output,pressure,staged authority/downstream terminal pressure without admitted delta is rejected or nonclosing. Materialization-required empty targets,unsatisfied role policy or unreachable write roots cannot become prompt/closure attempt when lineage requires materialization; type nonconformance/block before worker. Executive-observer pressure findings enter admitted evaluate.C under selected composition and cannot carry event/ledger/graph-frame/transition/continuation/closure authority.')
x.c('artifact_declared_schema',0,91,91,'Declared artifact schema','A worker-authored file artifact MAY carry exactly one declared output schema. If declared, instruction renders it, plan digest covers it and ingress enforces before domain admission; violations are corrective payload_rejected with schema/structured issues and violating section withheld. It is sole artifact shape authority, not widened/replaced/duplicated by prose,parser,self-assessment or convention.')
x.u('artifact_schema_modality_and_gap',0,91,93,'artifact_declared_schema','Clause 028 permits an optional schema, while the following gap calls universal schema coverage an unrealized obligation. It reports optional instruction schemas, checks only declared sections present in attached result, and untyped undeclared artifacts; T-244 owns routing and post-5.0 adoption is separate.','Preserve the MAY/universal tension explicitly; do not strengthen clause 028 to EVERY, erase the reported gap, or claim universal shape enforcement.')
