x.c('bootstrap_scalar_seams',3,21,27,'Five scalar bootstrap seams','Exactly fdEvaluator,fpEvaluator,fpDispatch,fhAdmission,consequenceProjection are declaration-selectable scalar bootstrap seams. This is not exhaustive plugin surface: handler registry,C fibres,providers,event ingress/sinks,composed tasks/rules have separate governing requirements. Catalog defaults map each seam to plugin own declared contract ref, never another seam.')
