x.u('per_instance_grant_gap',3,35,35,'capability_authority_and_steering','Per-instance approval attribution is not realized on all routes. Missing actor,grant,approval-policy,scope,basis must remain typed non-admitted rather than inferred from steering/env/package/class ratification; T-244 routing remains.','Retain stated non-admission boundary and reported incomplete realization.')
